<p>Koi na tha uthaata jo lasha hussain ka<br />
Aisa tabaah ho gaya kunba hussain ka</p>

<p>Kyu'n apni fatah par na ho naazaa'n sipaahe shaam<br />
Maara hai cheh maheene ka bacha hussain ka</p>

<p>Armaan dil me aur jigar me sina ka phal<br />
Mithi pa lot tha hai kaleja hussain ka</p>

<p>Wo pyaas aur wo qushk gala aur wo kund tegh<br />
wo saqt hath aur wo tadapna hussain na</p>

<p>Sab apne rishtedaaro'n ki mayyat ko le gaye<br />
Be waarisa sa reh gaya lasha hussain ka</p>

<p>Kya saqt waaqea hai ke jo aaj tak ghayyoor <br />
Le le ke naam roti hai dunya hussain ka<br />
</p>